/-!
# Literal auxiliary words for the J₃ sixth-power derivation

Balanced lookup keeps each generator selection logarithmic. Integer encodings
decode to ordinary signed lists before the kernel checks each operation.
These definitions prescribe actual words in the original two generators.

Generated by `source/emit.py` from the retained certificate. The generator
is untrusted; the Lean kernel checks each computation and proof application.
Source: ATLAS J3G1-P1, https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/J3/mag/J3G1-P1.M .
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Janko3.RecognitionPresentation.OrderBound.M1Finite.Relations.SixthPower
